        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, low voltage, photovoltaic mix slanted-roof, at house</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, low voltage, photovoltaic mix slanted-roof, at house
This dataset describes the transformation from medium to low voltage as well as the distribution of electricity at low voltage.;
UUID: 3c0abf39-b502-3265-a8ee-a4f51b60f431
Included are the electricity production in , the transmission network as well as direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during low-voltage transmission and transformation from medium-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on Swiss data.
Technology: Average technology used to distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air- and SF6-insulated medium-to-low voltage switching stations. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: total electricity in Switzerland: 0 TWh
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3c0abf39-b502-3265-a8ee-a4f51b60f431.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
